        {
          "id": "89cafaa1-6f44-4e52-8e14-00154307bb20",
          "name": "Landing page details",
          "request": {
            "name": "Landing page details",
            "description": {
              "content": "Shows details of a landing page\n\n## Landing Page Attributes\n* `title` (string) - Title of the landing page\n* `url` (string) - URL of the landing page\n* `publish_at` (string) - Date and time the landing page will be published\n* `created_at` (string) - Date and time the landing page was created\n* `updated_at` (string) - Date and time the landing page was updated\n\n## Sparse Fields\n### Only return title attribute\n* `GET /v1/landing_pages/123?fields[landing_pages]=title`\n\nResponse will only include requested fields\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"123\",\n    \"type\": \"landing_pages\",\n    \"attributes\": {\n      \"title\": \"Course Landing Page\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "landing_pages",
                ":id"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "fields[landing_pages]",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Partial attributes as specified, e.g. fields[landing_pages]=title"
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "id",
                  "description": "(Required) Landing page ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/vnd.api+json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
